  "note": "Inner-corner pieces of the tight fort.emplacement collar in three states. Built-in ImageGen reskin of templates/fort-emplacement-corners-guide.png (fort-emplacement-corners-guide.py, intact patch as material reference); exact prompt retained (fort-emplacement-corners.prompt.txt), raw retained unmodified, 1536x1024 RGBA with the 4x3 block held on the 192px grid. Each frame is platform concrete with one parapet notch in the named corner: the piece at a diagonal ring cell, joining the two edge pieces that meet at the body's corner. Doodads, not a block: no GridLayout resolves a diagonal. The ids are the CoverPropDamage family, so rounds wear them intact -> damaged -> destroyed. New sheet, shares no id with a shipped tileset.",
